423: ## Phase 6: Common Build Errors & Fixes
424: 
425: ### Error: "unresolved external symbol"
426: 
427: **Cause:** Missing .cpp files in project
428: 
429: **Fix:**
430: ```
431: Right-click project → Properties → 
432: VC++ Directories → Source Directories → 
433: Add "src/"
434: ```
435: 
436: Then add all .cpp files to project.
437: 
438: ### Error: "cannot open include file"
439: 
440: **Cause:** Include path incorrect
441: 
442: **Fix:**
443: ```cpp
444: // Instead of:
445: #include "GameOffsets.h"
446: 
447: // Use relative path:
448: #include "src/GameOffsets.h"
449: // Or add "src/" to include directories
450: ```
451: 
452: ### Error: "'std::unique_ptr': no appropriate default constructor"
453: 
454: **Cause:** Trying to default-construct unique_ptr without assignment
455: 
456: **Fix:**
457: ```cpp
458: // Wrong:
